---
import EpilineCaseLayout from '../../../layouts/EpilineCaseLayout.astro';
const visuals=[
 {src:'https://epiline.lv/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/epiline_articles-3.webp',label:'LASER EPILATION / CONTENT SYSTEM',n:'01'},
 {src:'https://epiline.lv/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/epiline_articles-10.webp',label:'RF LIFTING / EDITORIAL',n:'02'},
 {src:'https://epiline.lv/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/epiline_articles-6.webp',label:'HYDRAFACIAL / ORGANIC CONTENT',n:'03'},
 {src:'https://epiline.lv/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/epiline_articles-16.webp',label:'BODY TREATMENTS / CONTENT',n:'04'}
];
---
<EpilineCaseLayout title="Epiline website case" description="A complete bilingual website rebuild for Epiline in Riga and Jurmala." eyebrow="WEBSITE / CONVERSION / SEO" headline="We threw the old" accent="website away." intro="In 2025 we stopped patching the old website and built a new Epiline platform from scratch — without treating SEO, booking and conversion as separate projects." metrics={[{value:'2025',label:'new website launched'},{value:'2',label:'languages · Latvian + Russian'},{value:'2',label:'markets · Riga + Jurmala'},{value:'1',label:'connected acquisition platform'}]}>
<section class="case-section shell"><div class="two"><span class="eyebrow">THE DECISION</span><div><h2>Starting again<br/>was cleaner.</h2><p class="statement">The old site was not redesigned. It was replaced.</p><p>The new website was designed around the way an aesthetic clinic actually acquires patients: service discovery, treatment research, trust, search visibility and a clear path to booking.</p></div></div></section>

<section class="showcase"><div class="shell"><div class="showcase-head"><span class="eyebrow">EPILINE.LV / REAL PROJECT MATERIALS</span><h2>A website needs<br/>a visual system.</h2><p>These are real assets from the Epiline website and editorial system — not stock mockups created for this case.</p></div><div class="hero-visual"><div class="browser"><div class="browserbar"><span>● ● ●</span><b>epiline.lv</b><span>2025 →</span></div><img src="https://epiline.lv/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/epiline_articles-3.webp" alt="Epiline website visual for laser epilation" loading="lazy" /></div><div class="visual-caption eyebrow"><span>01 / TREATMENT CONTENT</span><span>REAL EPILINE ASSET</span></div></div><div class="visual-grid">{visuals.slice(1).map(v=><figure><div class="image-wrap"><img src={v.src} alt={v.label} loading="lazy" /></div><figcaption class="eyebrow"><span>{v.n}</span><span>{v.label}</span></figcaption></figure>)}</div></div></section>

<section class="case-section accent"><div class="shell"><span class="eyebrow">THE ARCHITECTURE</span><h2>More than<br/>a new interface.</h2><div class="flow"><span>PAID TRAFFIC</span><b>→</b><span>SERVICE PAGES</span><b>→</b><span>CONTENT / SEO</span><b>→</b><span>ONLINE BOOKING</span><b>→</b><span>CRM</span></div><div class="data-list"><div class="data-row"><span>Languages</span><span>Local patient journeys</span><strong>LV + RU</strong></div><div class="data-row"><span>Commercial structure</span><span>Treatment-focused landing pages</span><strong>CONVERSION</strong></div><div class="data-row"><span>Editorial structure</span><span>Search-led content</span><strong>SEO</strong></div><div class="data-row"><span>Booking</span><span>Connected to operations</span><strong>ALTEGIO</strong></div></div></div></section>

<section class="page-system shell"><div class="system-head"><span class="eyebrow">ONE BRAND / MANY ENTRY POINTS</span><h2>Commercial pages.<br/>Editorial pages.<br/>One patient journey.</h2></div><div class="system-grid"><div class="system-card"><span class="eyebrow">SERVICE / LV</span><h3>Lāzerepilācija</h3><p>Commercial treatment architecture built for high-intent traffic and booking.</p><a href="https://epiline.lv/laser-epilation/">OPEN PAGE ↗</a></div><div class="system-card darkcard"><span class="eyebrow">SERVICE / LV</span><h3>Morpheus 8</h3><p>A treatment page that connects search intent, education and conversion.</p><a href="https://epiline.lv/kosmetologija/morpheus-8/">OPEN PAGE ↗</a></div><div class="system-card bluecard"><span class="eyebrow">CONTENT / SEO</span><h3>Endospheres</h3><p>Search-led editorial content brings patients into the website before they choose a clinic.</p><a href="https://epiline.lv/endosfera-5-biezak-uzdotie-jautajumi-par-proceduru/">OPEN CONTENT ↗</a></div></div></section>

<section class="case-section shell"><div class="two"><span class="eyebrow">SEO MIGRATION</span><div><h2>New website.<br/>Not zero visibility.</h2><p>An established domain carries years of accumulated search equity. Rebuilding the interface while ignoring that would mean solving one problem and creating another.</p><p>SEO was therefore part of the rebuild from the start: the new structure had to support paid acquisition and conversion while protecting and expanding organic visibility.</p><a class="back" href="https://epiline.lv/">Visit Epiline.lv ↗</a></div></div></section>
<section class="case-section dark"><div class="shell two"><span class="eyebrow">THE RESULT</span><div><h2>The website became<br/>infrastructure.</h2><p class="statement">Paid traffic, organic search, content and booking now meet in one platform.</p><p>That is the role of RM Sites in a long-term acquisition system: not simply to make the clinic look newer, but to make every other channel work through a stronger conversion layer.</p></div></div></section>
</EpilineCaseLayout>
<style>
.showcase{background:#d9d8d1;padding:130px 0}.showcase-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.55fr 1.25fr .6fr;gap:50px;align-items:start;margin-bottom:70px}.showcase-head h2,.system-head h2{font-size:clamp(48px,6vw,92px);line-height:.92;letter-spacing:-.06em;margin:0;font-weight:600}.showcase-head p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;margin:0;color:var(--muted)}.hero-visual{margin-bottom:14px}.browser{background:#111;padding:12px;border-radius:4px}.browserbar{height:38px;background:#f2f1ec;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;align-items:center;padding:0 14px;font-family:monospace;font-size:9px}.browserbar b{text-align:center;font-weight:400}.browserbar span:last-child{text-align:right}.browser img{width:100%;height:min(65vw,760px);object-fit:cover;display:block}.visual-caption,figcaption{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 2px}.visual-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.25fr .75fr .75fr;gap:10px;margin-top:45px}.visual-grid figure{margin:0}.image-wrap{background:#111;padding:8px}.image-wrap img{width:100%;height:420px;object-fit:cover;display:block}.visual-grid figure:nth-child(2) img,.visual-grid figure:nth-child(3) img{height:320px}.page-system{padding:140px 0}.system-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.55fr 1.45fr;gap:70px;margin-bottom:75px}.system-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px}.system-card{min-height:390px;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:25px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.system-card h3{font-size:clamp(35px,4vw,58px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-.055em;margin:90px 0 20px}.system-card p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted);max-width:300px}.system-card a{margin-top:auto;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid currentColor;font-family:monospace;font-size:10px}.darkcard{background:var(--dark);color:var(--white);border-color:var(--dark)}.darkcard p{color:#888}.bluecard{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent)}@media(max-width:800px){.showcase{padding:90px 0}.showcase-head,.system-head{grid-template-columns:1fr}.visual-grid,.system-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.browser img,.image-wrap img,.visual-grid figure:nth-child(2) img,.visual-grid figure:nth-child(3) img{height:auto}.system-card{min-height:320px}}
</style>